<h2>Manufacturing process improvement</h2>

<p>At Organización Corona, I supported manufacturing engineering activities focused on plastic raw-material recovery, process monitoring, and production improvement.</p>

<p>My work combined production data analysis, statistical process control, and technical evaluation to identify opportunities to improve manufacturing performance and reduce material waste.</p>

<h2>Main responsibilities</h2>

<ul class="clean-list">
<li>Plastic Raw-Material Recovery: Supported the technical and financial planning of a project focused on recovering plastic materials.</li>
<li>Statistical Process Control: Developed an SPC approach for monitoring plastic injection molding machines.</li>
<li>Production Data Analysis: Evaluated process data to identify variability, waste, and improvement opportunities.</li>
<li>Process Improvement: Supported the identification and evaluation of practical actions to improve manufacturing performance.</li>
<li>Team Collaboration: Worked with manufacturing and engineering teams to translate technical requirements into production improvements.</li>
</ul>

<p>This experience strengthened my knowledge of manufacturing processes, statistical quality control, production analysis, and continuous improvement.</p>
